          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በመቃብር ይጥሉታል ፥ ⟪ወያነሥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እዎ ፥⟫ በትንሣኤ ያነሡታል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወያውዕይዎ በእሳት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በገሃነም ፍዳ ያመጡበታል ። አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንድም ይገልይዎ ወይገምድዎ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያወጽእዎ ወይገድፍዎ ያስተጋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብእዎ ወያነሥእዎ ወያውዕይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዎ ይላል አብነት ። ይገልይዎ ነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍሱን ከሥጋው ፥ ይገምድዎ ሥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጋውን ከነፍሱ ይለዩታል ፡ ያወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽእዎ ከቤት ፡ ይገድፍዎ በመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃብር ፡ ያስተጋብእዎ በትንሣኤ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘጉባኤ ። ያነሥእዎ ፤ ያሥነሡታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ል ያውዕይዎ በገሃነም ፍዳ ያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጡበታል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእመሰ ነበርክሙ ብየ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": "፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኔ አምናችሁ ብትኖሩ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወነበረ ቃልየ ኀቤክሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያስተማርኋችሁም ትምርት በና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንተ ጸንቶ ቢኖር ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ኵሉ ዘፈቀድክሙ ይከውን ለ",
