          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከወደዳችሁኝ ትእዛዜን ጠብቁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሀልዉ በፍቅረ ዚአየ⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኔ ፍቅር ፀንታችሁ ኑሩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በከመ ዓቀብኩ አነ ኵሎ ትእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዛዞ ለአቡየ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኔ ያባቴን ትእዛዛት እንደ ጠ",
